    "description": "Conjure a cloud of noxious magic, rapidly rotting everything within it. Designate a point within Rng of the spell. All units within a 1 tile square radius of that point suffer 2d8 Decay damage and 1 Brk. Affected units must also succeed a Mgt Saving Throw (DC = 10 + caster Wit) or else suffer the Corpse Rot condition for 3 turns. Corpse Rot deals another 2d8 Decay damage and 1 Brk each turn. Units with Corpse Rot are considered Undead, lose any protection against Slashing, Piercing, Crushing and Missile damage, and cannot be healed.",
